    "blurb": "Hundreds of luminous drones morph between geometric 3D constellations on a cosmic black backdrop, tracking participants with individual colours and sonic shockwaves.",
    "prompt": "A drone swarm, one glowing drone per person in their own colour plus a few hundred white ones: anyone can call the next formation, and the whole swarm flies into it -- a star, a wave, a spiral, a word-free pictogram. Make it striking on a big projected wall in a dark room: a bold composition, rich colour against real blacks, depth, glow, and motion that reads from across the room. Keep a demoscener's economy: lookup tables and fixed-size buffers kept in room.state, low-resolution offscreen buffers for any per-pixel work, nothing allocated inside hot loops, a steady 60fps at 1920x1080, and compact, clearly named code.",
